    "collapsible_content_fdKQDU": {
      "type": "collapsible-content",
      "blocks": {
        "collapsible_row_w6Y9t6": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product Details",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>DESCECI Premium DTF Ink is formulated for professional Direct to Film printing, delivering vibrant color reproduction, smooth ink flow, and consistent printing performance.</p><ul><li><strong>Ink Type:</strong> Water-Based Pigment Ink</li><li><strong>Colors:</strong> Cyan, Magenta, Yellow, Black & White</li><li><strong>Available Sizes:</strong> 250ML / 500ML / 1000ML</li><li><strong>Application:</strong> Direct to Film (DTF) Printing</li><li><strong>Recommended For:</strong> T-Shirts, Hoodies, Tote Bags, Sweatshirts & More</li></ul>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_DRx9MH": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Printer Compatibility",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Designed for a wide range of DTF printing systems.</p><ul><li>XP600 Print Heads</li><li>I3200 Print Heads</li><li>Epson-Based DTF Printers</li><li>Most DTF Printing Systems</li></ul><p>For best results, always confirm ink compatibility with your printer model and existing ink system before use.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_CVPTEf": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Storage & Usage",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>For consistent printing performance, store DTF ink properly and follow your printer manufacturer's maintenance recommendations.</p><ul><li>Store at <strong>59°F–86°F (15°C–30°C)</strong></li><li>Keep away from direct sunlight and excessive heat</li><li>Keep the bottle tightly sealed when not in use</li><li>Shake white ink thoroughly before use</li><li>Avoid mixing with incompatible ink formulations</li><li>Recommended shelf life: <strong>12 months</strong> when properly stored</li></ul><p>For best results, maintain regular circulation and printer maintenance, especially when using white DTF ink.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_hmFQ83": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping & Support",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "row_content": "<p>Every bottle is securely packaged to help prevent leaks and damage during transportation.</p><p>If your order arrives damaged, leaking, or with an incorrect item, please contact our customer support team with your order number and photos of the package and product.</p><p>Our team is available to help with product questions, compatibility concerns, and order support.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
